      "texts": {
        "en": "A terminal record MUST be rooted in an Authority explicitly recognized by the local Context for the exact binding and policy epoch.",
        "pt-BR": "Um registro terminal DEVE estar enraizado em uma Authority explicitamente reconhecida pelo Context local para a vincula\u00e7\u00e3o exata e a \u00e9poca de pol\u00edtica.",
